---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getLocaleFromUrl, t, getLocalizedPath } from '../../i18n/utils';

const locale = getLocaleFromUrl(Astro.url);

const functii = [
  { key: 'feature1', detaliu: 'Every need is entered linked to the budget line it is paid from, not separately.' },
  { key: 'feature2', detaliu: 'Lines are grouped by CPV code and the plan is generated from them, not written by hand.' },
  { key: 'feature3', detaliu: 'The needs memo travels the signature flow, recording who issued and who approved it, and when.' },
  { key: 'feature4', detaliu: 'Supporting documents stay attached to the line, in the procurement archive.' },
  { key: 'feature5', detaliu: 'When new budget lines appear at a revision, the plan updates without being rewritten.' },
];

const laControl = [
  {
    intrebare: 'Which stated need does this line rest on?',
    raspuns: 'The line stays linked to the needs memo that generated it, with number, date and issuing department.',
  },
  {
    intrebare: 'How was the estimated value determined?',
    raspuns: 'The method is recorded alongside the value, not reconstructed from memory afterwards.',
  },
  {
    intrebare: 'What else was bought for the same need?',
    raspuns: 'Similar needs are identified before the procedure is chosen, not after the threshold has been passed.',
  },
  {
    intrebare: 'Who changed this line, and when?',
    raspuns: 'Every change leaves a record. When people move on, traceability stays.',
  },
];

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'SoftwareApplication',
  name: 'ePAAP',
  applicationCategory: 'BusinessApplication',
  applicationSubCategory: 'Public procurement software',
  operatingSystem: 'Web',
  inLanguage: 'en',
  description:
    'A platform for the annual public procurement plan and needs memos: collecting needs, grouping by CPV code, the signature flow, supporting documents and the history of changes.',
  url: 'https://bid-management.ro/en/epaap',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Equalys Services', url: 'https://bid-management.ro' },
  audience: { '@type': 'Audience', audienceType: 'Contracting authorities' },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'Country', name: 'România' },
};
---

<Layout
  title="ePAAP — the platform for the annual plan and needs memos"
  description="The platform for the annual public procurement plan and needs memos: needs linked to budget lines, CPV grouping, signature flow, history after every change."
  schema={[schema]}
  noSuffix
>
  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-navy via-navy-800 to-navy text-white py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-accent-light/15 border border-accent-light/30 rounded-full mb-6">
          <span class="text-accent-light text-sm font-medium">For contracting authorities</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
          ePAAP — <span class="text-accent-light">the plan and the memos</span> in a single flow
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          From a need sent in by a department to the approved line in the annual plan, with the
          history that stays after every change.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">
          {t(locale, 'authoritiesPage.epaapBenefits')}
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href={getLocalizedPath(locale, '/contact')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-accent-light hover:bg-mint text-navy font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
            {t(locale, 'authoritiesPage.epaapCta')}
          </a>
          <a href={getLocalizedPath(locale, '/resurse/referat-de-necesitate-campuri-minime')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 border border-white/25 hover:border-accent-light hover:text-accent-light text-gray-200 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
            What a defensible needs memo contains
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CE FACE ===== -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-12">What it does</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        {functii.map((f, i) => (
          <div class="flex gap-4 bg-surface border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-accent text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center tabular-nums">
              {i + 1}
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-navy mb-1">{t(locale, `epaap.${f.key}`)}</h3>
              <p class="text-text-light text-sm leading-relaxed m-0">{f.detaliu}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CE VEDE CONTROLUL ===== -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-navy text-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4">What an audit sees</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl">
        An audit walks the chain backwards: it starts from the contract and asks for the document
        that justified it. These are the questions, and what answers each one.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {laControl.map((c) => (
          <div class="border border-white/15 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-accent-light font-semibold mb-2 m-0">{c.intrebare}</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">{c.raspuns}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-8">
        The aggregation mechanism, with the thresholds in force and the legal basis for each, is set
        out in
        <a href={getLocalizedPath(locale, '/resurse/praguri-achizitii-publice')} class="text-accent-light hover:underline">the 2026 thresholds page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CUM SE ACHIZIȚIONEAZĂ ===== -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">How to procure it</h2>
      <p class="text-text text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Like any public purchase, it starts from a needs memo that requires an estimated value and
        the method by which it was determined. We send a named quote for your institution, which
        you can use as the source of that estimated value, with date and issuer.
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-8">
        <p class="text-text leading-relaxed m-0">
          If it helps, we can also send the structure of the memo for this type of purchase. The
          minimum fields, each with its legal basis, are public anyway, on
          <a href={getLocalizedPath(locale, '/resurse/referat-de-necesitate-campuri-minime')} class="text-accent hover:underline">the needs memo page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href={getLocalizedPath(locale, '/contact')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-navy hover:bg-navy-light text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
        Request a named quote
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
